<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id" />
  <para style="h">JEKARIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Jekaria</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jekaria</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jek</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JEKARIA</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Buk pa Jekaria </char> kipoko iye aryo mapatpat: (1) Lok me nebi ma lanebi Jekaria otito ikine ka mwaka miya abic ki pyere aryo nio kwede wa i mwaka miya abic ki apar wiye aboro, i mwaka ma pud peya kinywalo Yecu Kricito. Magi ducu pole tye macalo lanyut, dok mako lok me roco Jerucalem, ki roco Ot pa Lubanga, ki lonyo jo pa Lubanga, ki kare ma Lalar bibino iye (Cura 1—8). (2) Lok mapol ma kito ma mako kom Lalar ki lok me binone kacel ki ngolo kop me agiki (Cura 9—14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lok me juk ki bedo ki gen <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 1:1-8:23">1:1—8:23</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ngolo kop ikom lobo ma orumu Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 9:1-8">9:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lonyo ki kuc ma bibino i anyim <char style="ior"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9-14:21">9:9—14:21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot Lubanga lwongo jone me dwogo cen bote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:24-5:1">Eji 4:24—5:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6:14">6:14</ref></char>
    </note>I dwe me aboro i mwaka me aryo me loc pa Dario rwot me Percia, Rwot oloko bot lanebi Jekaria wod pa Berekia, wod pa Iddo kun waco ni, <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />“Kiniga yam omaka matek ikom kwariwu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Ento kombedi dong awaco botwu ni, ‘Dong wudwog cen bota, ci an bene abidwogo botwu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />Pe wubed macalo kwariwu. Yam lunebi macon gubedo katito botgi lok ni guwek kit meggi maracu me timo bali woko. Ento yam pe gumedo ki winyone, pe bene gumedo ki keto cwinygi ikoma. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />Kwariwu kombedi dong gitye wa kwene mono? Kadi wa lunebi bene pe gibedo kwo nakanaka. <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Ento loka ducu mayam aciko nia ki i dog lutica ma gin lunebi gin gucayo woko dok bene pe gulubu omiyo apwodogi. Ci gin gungut kun giwaco ni an Rwot me mony dong atiyo kit mayam ayubu kwede pi timo kwariwu muporo kitgi ki timgi.’”<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kinyutu ginanyuta me aguragura bot Jekaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Ikom nino dwe pyere aryo wiye angwen, i dwe me apar wiye acel, ma kilwongo ni Cebat, i mwaka me loc pa Dario me aryone, Rwot dok oloko kweda i ginanyuta. <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2-8">Niy 6:2-8</ref></char></note>I ginanyuta meno aneno dano mo i dyewor, ma oyito iwi aguragura makwar, ci ocung kwede ikin yadi ma ngwecgi kur ma gitye i lung; ki tung yo ngeye onongo tye iye lwak aguragura makwar ki ma opilopilo, ki matare. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />Ci apenyo ni, “Ladit, lwak aguragura magi kono telokgi ango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 1:9">Ci lamalaika ma onongo obedo kalok kwedani owaco bota ni, “Abinyutu telok magi boti.” <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Ci dano ma onongo ocung ikin yadi ma ngwecgi kuri ogamo ni, “Magi gin aye lwak jo ma Rwot oorogi kawire pi ngiyo dye lobo ducu.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Ci lungwec ki aguragurani gudwoko lok bot lamalaika ma onongo ocung ikin yadi ma ngwecgi kuri kun giwaco ni, “Dong watyeko wire walongo i lobo ducu; nen, i lobo ducu tye mukwe gire mot.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Lacen lamalaika pa Rwot dok openyo ni, “Ai Rwot me mony, ibitero kare marom mene ma nongo peya itimo kica ki Jerucalem, kacel ki taun madito ma i Juda ducu, ma in dong ikeco ikomgi pi mwaka pyere abiro kuluni?”<verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Ci Rwot odok iye ki lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani, kun wace lok mabeco me kica bene. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Omiyo lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani owaca ni atit lok ma Rwot me mony owacani ni, “Nyeko tye kamaka matek ma okato ducu pi Jerucalem ki pi Cion. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Dok kiniga omaka matek ikom rok mapol ma gitye mot ki kuc. Pien ikare ma akwanyo kinigana woko ki ikom jona, en aye dok obedo kare ma gin rok meno gumedo iye lwak can mapol ikom jona. <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Pieno an Rwot dong atyeko dwogo cen i Jerucalem kanyutu kicana madwong bote. Kibiroco Ot pa Rwot, dok bene kibigero taun madit me Jerucalem odoco.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Lamalaika dok omede kitito lok man ni Rwot me mony waco ni, “Taun mera madito ducu bipong lipim ki gin mabeco dok aye, ci dok abikweyo cwiny Cion ka dok abiyero Jerucalem aye me bedo mera.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me Tung lee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />I ginanyuta mukene dok aneno tung lee angwen. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Ci apenyo lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani ni, “Tung lee magi kono telokgi ango?” En odoka iye ni, “Magi gin aye tung lee ma gukeyo i Juda woko atata, ki Icrael ki Jerucalem bene.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Rwot dok onyutu bota lutet angwen. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Ci apenyo ni, “Jonu gubino katimo kit gin ango ka?” Ci en ogamo ni, “Mony ma tung lee magi ocung pirigini aye rok mayam gukeyo i Juda woko atatani, omiyo guneno can atikani. Ento lutet magi gubino kamiyo lworo ikom rok ducu mayam gubalo lobo Judani wek lworo opot ikomgi ci kityekgi woko bene.”<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Gin anyuta ikom tol lapim piny</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />I ginanyuta mukene dok aneno dano mo matye ki tol lapim piny i cinge! <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Ci apenye ni, “In mono ibicito wa kwene ka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:2">En odok iye bota ni, “Acito ka pimo Jerucalem, wek anen kit ma lac me iye ki bore tye rom kwede.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Ci aneno lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani ka bino anyim, ka dok lamalaika acel mukene bene obino ka rwate kwede. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />Ci lamalaika mukwongo ca owaco bot lawote ni, “Ring icit wa bot awobi ca matye ki tol lapim piny i cingeni wek iwace ni: Jerucalem bibedo apero labongo cel murume pi lwak dano mapol ma bibedo iye kacel ki lee mapol ata ma bibedo iye miyo pe dong kibiromo cweyo cel i kabedone. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Rwot owaco ni en kikome aye ma ibibedo macalo cel gogo me mac me gwokogi, dok en aye bene ibibedo deyone manen ki i iye kunu.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kilwongo jo ma kiterogi i opii pi dwogo paco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />Rwot dok owaco kuman ni, “Wuring woko! Wua woko ki i lobo Babilon, pien con aketo iwu woko atata i kabedo ducu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Wun jo me Cion, wulwi, wuring wudwog woko cen i Jerucalem, wun jo ma wubedo i Babilon. <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Ngat ma timowu Cion marac nongo ogudu tong wanga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 2:8">Ci Rwot me mony ma en aye Won Deyo oora bot lurok mapatpat mayam guyako Cion kun waco kuman ni, <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />“An kikoma aye abilweny ikomgi, dok jo mayam gubedo opiigi aye bene gibiyakogi.” Ka man otime bimiyo wungeyoni Rwot me mony aye ma oora.<verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />Rwot owaco kuman ni, “Dong wuwer ki yomcwiny, wun jo Cion; pien nen an dong abibino kabedo i dyewu.”<verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />Ikare meno rok mapol bibino gibiloke gidok bot Rwot, ci dong gibidoko jone. En bene bibedo i dyewu, dok wubingeyo ni, Rwot me mony aye ma oora botwu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />Lobo pa jo Juda dok bibedo lobo maleng pa Rwot; en dok biyero Jerucalem aye me bedo taun mere madit maleng makato.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Wuling woko litik inyim Rwot wun jo ducu, pien en dong oa woko malo ki i kabedone maleng.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta ma Lanebi oneno ikom ajwaka madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 5:2">Eji 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">Niy 12:10</ref></char>
    </note> I ginanyuta mukene, Rwot dok onyuta Yocwa, ma en ajwaka madit, ma onongo ocung inyim lamalaika pa Rwot. Catan bene onongo ocung tung cinge ma lacuc kun tye atera me tongo lok me adot ikome. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Jud 9</ref></char></note> Ci lamalaika pa Rwot owaco ki Catan ni, “Rwot myero ojuki in Catan! Rwot mayam oyero Jerucalem myero ojuki! Man pe en aye dog yen ma kikwanyo woko ki i mac?”<verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Yocwa onongo ocung kun oruku bongi ma cilo mada. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Ci lamalaika ocako owaco ki jo ma gucung inyime ni, “Wuluny bongi ma ciloni woko ki ikome.” Ka dok owaco bot Yocwa ni, “Nen, dong atyeko kwanyo bali woko ki ikomi, dong abiruki ki ginaruka me deyo.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Dok owaco ki jo ma gucung kangeteni ni, “Wudwal kitambara maleng iwiye.” Ci gucako dwalo kitambara maleng iwiye, ka dok guruke ki bongi manyen, kun lamalaika pa Rwot ocung kangete.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Lamalaika pa Rwot dok ociko Yocwa matek kun waco ni, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />“Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni: kace ibilubu yona, kun igwoko loka ducu ma aciko, ci ibiloyo oda, kun igwoko dyekala bene, dok abimiyo ki in twer me bino wa bota ikin jo ma gicung kany.<verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:5">Jer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:15">33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">Jek 6:12</ref></char>
    </note>Winy ba, Yocwa, in ajwaka madit, ki wun ajwaki ma wutiyo kacel bene wuwiny, pien wun aye lanyut ma cimo gin ma bitime i anyim. Nen, an dong abikelo latica, en ma kilwongo ni Jang Yat. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />Pien nen, aketo kidi inyim Yocwa, kidi acel matye ki twoke abiro, en aye abigoro coc ikome, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome, dok abikwanyo alii me bal me loboni woko ducu inino acel keken. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:4">Mik 4:4</ref></char></note> Ka kare meno dong oromo, ci ngat acel acel ma ikinwu bibedo ite oloke ki ite odurune ki kuc labongo lworo mo. Kun bilwongo lawote wek obin onywak bedo kwede, man lok pa an Rwot me mony kikome.”<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me lacib mac tara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Ci lamalaika ma ceng obedo kalok kwedani dok obino bota, ocako coya woko, kit macalo kicoyo dano ki iwang nino. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Ci en ocako penya ni, “Ineno gin ango?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ZEC 4:2">Ci adoke iye ni, “Aneno lacib mac tara ma kome ducu obedo jabu ki atabo moo iwiye, ki tara abiro ma kicibogi iwiye, kun tara acel acel ma kicibo iwiyeni tye ki doge abiro. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Niy 11:4</ref></char></note>Yadi jeituni aryo tye gucung kangete, acel tung acuc me atabo moo, ki acel mukene tung acam.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Ci dok apenyo lamalaika ma obedo kalok kweda ni, “Ladit, magi gin ango ka?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Ci en odoka iye ni, “In pe ingeyo jami magi?” An dok agamo ni, “Pe angeyo gira, ladit.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10b" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10b" />Ci lamalaikanu owaca ni, “Mac tara abironi gin aye wang Rwot ma gibedo kangiyo lobo ducu.” <verse eid="ZEC 4:10b" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Niy 11:4</ref></char></note> Ci dok anwoyo penyo lamalaikanu ni, “Yadi jeituni aryoni ma gitye inget tara tung ryoryoni kono tyen loke ango?” <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Ka dok amede ki penye ni, “Jang yadi jeituni aryoni ma gitye inget paipo aryo me jabu ma moo tye kamol ki i igini kono tyen loke ango?”<verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Ka dok en openya ni, “Pe ingeyo jami magi?” Ci an adoke iye ni, “Pe angeyo, ladit.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Ci dong en otito bota ni, “Jang yadi aryo magi aye gucung pi jo aryo ma Rwot oyero ci owirogi ki moo wek gutii bote.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cike pa Lubanga bot Jerubabel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 5:2">Eji 5:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lamalaikanu dok owaca ni amii kwena pa Rwot bot Jerubabel kun awace ni, “Pe ki twer kadi ki teko, ento pi Cwiny mera, aye ibicobo tici kakare, man lok pa Rwot me mony kikome. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />In Jerubabel, ibibedo ki ariya mogo madito calo got ma myero itii dok icobgi woko kakare. Ento gibidoko calo bar inyimi. Ci in ibikelo got me agiki ma bicobo gero Ot pa Lubanga. Dong ikare ma ibiketo got me agiki iwiye ci dano gibiwo ki dwon malongo ni, ‘Ot man nen munya mada, Lubanga oket gum ma mere obed ikome!’”<verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Ci Rwot dok omede ki lok bota kun waca ni, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />“Jerubabel dong otyeko keto guti me ot man; En kikome aye bene bityekone. Man bimiyo jona gibingeyo ni, an Rwot me mony me polo aye ma aoro in botgi.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10a" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10a" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10a: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 5:6">Niy 5:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pien cwinygi pe yom pi neno ni tic man tye kawot mot tutwal. Ento gin dong gibibedo ki yomcwiny, ka gibineno ka Jerubabel tye ki lapim i cinge kun nongo tye kamede ki gero Ot pa Lubanga.”<verse eid="ZEC 4:10a" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me buk adola ma otware malo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Ka atingo wanga malo, ci aneno buk adola ma tware! <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Ci lamalaika openya ni, “Ineno gin ango?” Ci adoke iye ni, “Aneno buk adola matye katuk malo; bore romo puti apar, ki lac iye romo puti abic.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Ka lamalaika dok owaca ni, “Man en lok me ceno dano, ma woto i lobo ducu, pien kicoyo tung cel ni jo ducu ma kwalo kwo kibiryemogi woko ki i lobo cake tin, dok kicoyo bene i tung mukene ni, jo ducu ma kwongo kwong me goba kibiryemogi woko bene ki i lobo cake tin. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />Rwot Matwero Ducu waco ni en dong ebicwalo buk man me ceno dano me wot woko, wek ocit odony wa i ot pa lakwo ki i ot pa ngat ma kwongo kwong i nyinge gobagoba; ci bibedo i ode nio ka otyeko woko liweng, kadi wa bao ki godi ducu ma kigero kwede.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me dako ma obedo i aduku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Lacen lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani dok obino ci owaca ni, “Ting wangi malo kong inen gin mukene matye kakato wokoni.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Ka apenye ni, “Man kono gin ango?” Ci en odoka iye ni, “Man aduku ma kato woko.” Ka dok owaci, “Man bal matye i loboni ducu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Nen, adukunu kitiyo doge ki nyonyo racac mapek ma nongo kiumu ki doge, ci aneno dako mo onongo tye obedo i aduku!<verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Ci lamalaika owaco ni, “Dako man ocung pi tim marac.” Ci odiyo wi dakonu odwoko piny i aduku, ka dok odiro nyonyo mapek ca ocego ki doge woko liking. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Atingo wanga dok malo, ci aneno mon aryo ma gitye katware ma gibino tung bota kun yamo cero bwomgi; onongo gitye ki bwomgi matek macalo bwom acebe. Ci gucako tingo aduku ca gutero ikin lobo ki polo.<verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Ka dok apenyo lamalaika matye kalok kweda ni, “Gitero adukuni kono kwene?”<verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Ci lamalaika odoka iye ni, “I lobo me Cinar,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="fk">Cinar </char> obedo nying mukene ma kilwongo ki lobo Babilon. </note> wek kiger ot pire. Ka dong kigero otum, ci kibicibo adukunu i kabedo ma kiyubu pire kunu.”<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ginanyuta me gadigadi lweny angwen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Dok aloke atingo wanga malo ci aneno gadigadi lweny angwen ma gua ki ikin godi aryo; godine onongo gubedo godi nyonyo me mola. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:4">Niy 6:4</ref>,<ref loc="REV 6:5">5</ref></char></note>Gadigadi mukwongo onongo aguragura makwar aye tye kaywayone, me aryone onongo aguragura macol aye tye kaywayone, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2">Niy 6:2</ref></char></note> ento me adeke onongo aguragura matare, ki gadigadi me angwene onongo aguragura ma obedo abacabac aye tye kaywayone. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Ci apenyo lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani ni, “Magi teloke ango ladit?” <verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Niy 7:1</ref></char></note> Ci lamalaika odoka iye ni, “Magi yamo angwen me polo, kun gua ki inyim Rwot me lobo ducu. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Gadigadi ma aguragura macol aye tye kateloni onongo woto dok tung kumalo kun kemo lobo Babilon, aguragura matareni gicito meggi gidok tung kupotoceng, ki ma gubedo abacabaceni onongo giwoto gidok mere tung lobo matye tung kupiny.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Ikare ma aguragura gikati woko, gin gurune me cako wotgi oyotoyot me longo i lobo. Ka dong lamalaika ocikogi ni, “Citu, giwu wulong i lobo.” Ci gin bene guwoto gulongo i lobo. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Ci lamalaika ma obedo kalok kwedani dok olwonga ki dwon malongo kun waco bota ni, “Nen aguragura ma guwoto gudok tung kumalo kun gukemo lobo Babilon gukweyo akemo pa Rwot woko.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiciko ni kiruk lalukana iwi Yocwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Rwot dok oloko kweda kun waco bota ni, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />“Kwany mot pa jo magi ki ikin jo mayam kiterogi i opii: Keldai, Tobiya ki Jedaya, gin jo ma dong gudwogo ki i Babilon; wot kacel kwedgi nio wa i ot pa Yocia wod pa Jepania. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Gam ryal ki jabu ki botgi, ci itii kwede lalukana me ker, wek irwak iwi Yocwa wod pa Yekojadak, ma en aye ajwaka madit.” <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:15">33:15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:8">Jek 3:8</ref></char></note>Dok itit bote ni, Rwot me mony owaco kuman ni. “Dano ma kilwongoni Jang Yat bidongo i kabedo kama en tye iye, dok en bigero Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />En kikome aye bigero Ot pa Rwot; en bibedo ki deyo ma pore pi rwot, dok en bene bibedo iwi komker mere, ka bicako loyo jone. Ajwaka bene bibedo kanget komker mere, kun gin aryo ducu gibitic kacel ki kuc. <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Lalukana meno bibedo i Ot pa Rwot macalo gin me poyo wic bot Keldai, Tobiya, Jedaya ki Yocia wod pa Jepania.”<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Jo matye kamabor gibibino, gibikonyo jo ma gigero Ot pa Rwot; meno dong bimiyo wungeyo ni Rwot me mony aye ma oora botwu. Man bitime kace wubiketo cik pa Rwot ducu i tic.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot okwero rii kec me goba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Rwot oloko ki Jekaria i mwaka me angwen me loc pa rwot Dario, inino dwe angwen, me dwe me abongwen ma kilwongo Kiclev.<verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Jo me Betel onongo ceng guoro Carejer ki Regem-melek kacel ki lwakgi wek gucit kalego gum ki bot Rwot, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />dok bene me penyo ajwaki me Ot pa Rwot me mony kacel ki lunebi ni, “Wan mono myero wamede kakumu pi Ot pa Lubanga ma kibalo wokoni, dok karii kec i dwe me abic kit macalo yam wabedo katimo kwede pi lwak mwaka mapoli?”<verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Rwot me mony odok iye bota ni, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />“Peny jo ducu me lobo kacel ki lunebi ni, ikare mayam wubedo karii kec ki kakumu i dwe me abic ki me abiro, pi mwaka pyere abiro ma okatoni, onongo yam wubedo me woro an? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Ikare me karamagi mayam gibedo kacam ki kamat iyeni, onongo gucamo dok bene gumato pirgi ken gi gire.<verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Man aye obedo lok mayam Rwot omiyo bot lunebi ni gubed katito ikare ca ma onongo dano opong i Jerucalem ki kuc, kacel ki i taun ducu ma orumugi maber, ma jo mogo yam onongo gibedo wa i Negeb bene ki i pworgu ikare ca.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwero winyo dog Rwot aye omiyo kitero dano i opii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Rwot dok oloko ki Jekaria kun waco ni, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />“Ikare ca amiyo bot jona gin ma myero gutii matye atir dok kakare, dok bene ni gutim ber ki kica ngat man bot lawote. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Pe wubur dato, latin kic, labedo nyo lacan; pe myero ngat mo ki ikinwu oyub lok marac ki i cwinye ikom lawote.<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />Ento jona gukwero winyo loka, kun gicere acera; ma guloko ngegi, dok gudingo wa itgi woko ni wek pe giwiny. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Gin gudoko lujemo ci pe guwinyo cik ma mayam acwalo ki Cwiny mera maleng kun wok ki i dog lunebi ma gukwo ikare macon. Omiyo kiniga madit mada omako an Rwot me mony. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />Kit macalo alwongogi ci gin pe guwinya, ikare ma gin bene gilwonga, ci an bene akwero winyogi woko, man lok pa an Rwot me mony kikome. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />Ci aketogi woko ki yamo lapiru ma oterogi ikin rok ducu mayam pe gingeyo. Kitmeno omiyo lobo ma guwekoni obale woko labongo ngat mo ma bedo iye, omiyo lobo ma yomo cwiny dano odong obur.”<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike pi roco Jerucalem odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Rwot me mony oloko bota kun waco ni, <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />“Abedo ka mito konyo Jerucalem pi mar madit ma atye kwede ikom jone, mar man ma atye kwede ikomgini omiyo akemo madwong omaka ikom meroke. <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />An abidwogo cen i Cion, ci abibedo i dye Jerucalem, pieno Jerucalem kibilwongo ni taun madit me agena, en got pa Rwot me mony, got maleng. <verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Co ma otii ki mon ma otii dok gibibedo piny mot ma komgi opye i dyekal me Jerucalem, ki jo ma otii gibikomo ki tal ma ngat acel acel omako i cinge. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Yoo ducu ma i Jerucalem bipong ki awobe ki anyira ma gituku iye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Man twero nen calo gin ma pe twero time ki tung bot jo ma gudong ikare man, ento pe tye gin mo ma pe twere ki tung bota. <verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />An abilaro jona ki i lobo matye tung kunyango ki i lobo matye tung kupotoceng bene; <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />ci abikelogi gibibedo wa i dye Jerucalem; gin gibibedo jona ki an bene abibedo Lubangagi me agena ki ma opore.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Wubed ki tekcwiny. Wun dong wucako winyo lok acelu ma lunebi guloko botwu nia ikare ma kicako keto kwede guti me gero Ot pa Rwot Lubanga. <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Ikare macon ca yam pe kiculu mucara ki dano mo, wa pi lee bene pe kiculu, dok bene onongo kuc pe tye bot dano mo me kato woko ki me dwogo, pi lumerok; pien onongo amiyo ngat acel acel mon ki lawote. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Ento ikare man pe dong abitimo jo ma gudongi kit mayam atimo ikom jo macon ca, man lok pa an Rwot me mony kikome. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />Pieno abimiyo gibipito kodigi ma nongo piny opye mot, dok olokgi bene binyako nyiggi mabup, lobo biceko cam, ki polo bene bimiyo toyo luk i ngom; dong abimiyo gum magi ducu bot jona ma gudongi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />Wun jo me ot pa Juda ki jo me ot pa Icrael, yam nyingwu odoko me lacen dano ikin rok ducu; kombedi dong abilarowu, wek wubed lukel gum ikom jo mukene bene. Pe wulwor, wubed ki tekcwiny, wujing komwu wumede ki gero Ot mera”<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Pien Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Yam ka kwariwu gumiyo akemo omaka ci ayube me timogi marac, dok bene pe aloko cwinya ci atimogi kumeno. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />Kitmeno ikare man bene dok ayube me timo Jerucalem maber ki ot pa Juda bene; pe dong wulwor. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Epe 4:25</ref></char></note>Man gin ma myero wutim: ngat man olok lok me ada bot lawote; wungol kop me ada makelo kuc ikin dano i dog gangiwu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />Pe myero ngat mo ikinwu oyub lok marac ki i cwinye ikom lawote; pe wumar kwongo kwong me goba, pien lok meno ducu cwinya dag matek.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Rwot me mony oloko bota kun waco ni, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />“Rii kec me dwe me angwen, me abic, me abiro, ki me dwe me apar, gibibedo nino madito me yomcwiny ki kwe ic pi ot pa Juda, ki me karama me yomcwiny; pieno wumar ada ki kuc.”<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco kuman ni, “Kare biromo ci rok mapatpat gibimede ki bino i Jerucalem. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />Jo ma gibedo i taun madit acel gibiwaco ki jo me taun madit mukene ni, ‘Wubin kacel kwedwa wek wacito wunu kaworo Rwot i Jerucalem wek walegu gum ki bot Rwot.’ <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Rok mapol ki rok matego gibibino i Jerucalem ka yenyo an Rwot me mony ki me lego kica bota. <verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />Ikare meno jo apar ma gua ki i lwak rok ma lebgi patpat gibimako dog kanyi pa Lajudaya, kun giwaco ni, ‘Wek wanywak wot kwedi, pien wawinyo ni Lubanga tye kwedwu.’”<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ngolo kop ikom rok ma kanget Jerucalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Ica 17:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Jer 49:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1:3-5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Ica 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eje 26:1—28:26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10:13-14</ref></char>
    </note> Man lok pa Rwot pi pwod ma bipoto ikom lobo Kadrak ki Damaciko. Pien taun madito ma i Aram gitye i cing Rwot, kacel ki kaka me Icrael ducu mere. <verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Kamat bene matye i wang apoki Kadrak bene mere, wa Turo ki Cidon bene, kadi bed giryek dok gidwong ki diro tic mada. <verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Turo ogero cel gogo pire kene gire, dok oguru ryal oyito malo calo kweyo, ki jabu bene macalo daba ma i gudu. <verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Ento Rwot biyako jamine woko, bicoro lonyo mere ducu i nam, en Turo kikome kibiwango woko ki mac.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Ica 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eje 25:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3:4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Jep 2:4-7</ref></char>
    </note>Acikelon bineno, dok lworo bimake; Taun madit me Gaja bene bineno, ci bilimo arem matek atika; Ekron bene kitmeno, pien kibibalo gin ma en genoni woko liweng. Kibineko rwot me Gaja woko; dok Acikelon bidong nono labongo dano mo iye. <verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Rok ma orube ata aye gibibedo i Acidod. Abigiko wake pa jo Piliciti woko. <verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />Pe dok abiweko gibicamo ringo ki remone kacel, wa cam me kipyeda ma gicamo ducu dong abikwanyone woko ki ikin gi. Ci jo ma gubwot gibidoko jo acel ki jona; gibidoko macalo kaka matye i Juda, ki Ekron bene bidoko calo jo Jebuc. <verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Abiguru kemana inget oda macalo lakurpiny, wek dul mony mo pe obed kakato ki ingete; Lugero mo ma burugi dong bene pe dok bidonyo ikin gi, pien kombedi an kikoma aye dong atyeko neno can gi ki wanga.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rwot ma biloyo Cion</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:5">Mat 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:15">Jon 12:15</ref></char>
    </note>Wubed ki yomcwiny madwong, wun jo Cion!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Wugo kijira, wun jo Jerucalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Wunen ka rwotwu bino botwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">ki deyo madit me loyo lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">kun obedo iwi kana ki mwolo, iwi latin kana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Jab 72:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Rwot owaco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">“Abijwero gadigadi lweny woko ki i Epraim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">ki aguragura lweny ki i Jerucalem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">atum me lweny ducu kibiturugi woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Rwot ma mewu aye bitito lok me kuc bot rok mukene ducu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">ker mere biloyo piny nia i nam tungcel nio i nam mukene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">kun a ki i kulu Euprate o wa i agiki lobo.”<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Roco Cion odoco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Nia 24:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Rwot waco kuman ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">“Pien an aketo remo me gicikena wan kwedi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">abigonyo joni ma kiterogi i opii ki i bur ma pii pe iye.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Wudok cen wa i cel gogowu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">wun lumabuc matye ki gen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">tin atucu atir ni abiculu wang can ma ikato ki iyeni tye kiryo ki makato.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />Pien dong abitiyo ki Juda macalo atuma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">ki Epraim macalo aterona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Jo Cion gubedo pala lucwan ma mera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">abitic kwedgi me lweny ikom jo Grik.”<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Ikare meno Rwot binen lamalo kawi jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">aterone biwil calo lutkot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">ci Rwot Lubanga bikutu tume matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">biwot ki i yamo lapiru ma tung acuc.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />Rwot me mony aye bibedo kwot pa jone,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">ci gibityengo latangdingogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">dok gibinyono lucelone woko piny;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">gibimato remogi macalo kongo bwino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">ci gibiyeng kwede macalo becen mupong,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">calo remo ma gicoro i gul keno tyer.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />Inino meno Rwot Lubanga bilaro jone macalo lakwat malaro romine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">pien gin jone; gin bibedo karyeny i lobone kitmeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">macalo lutino kidi me wel maryeny ikom lalukana.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Bere ki mwonyane dit ma pe tite!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">Kom awobe bibedo bulubulu pi kal agwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">ki kom anyira bene bibedo bulubulu pi kongo bwino manyen.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot ocike me laro lwake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Wugat kot ki bot Rwot i potokot, ka wugat kot ki bote i dye cwir, wek oa ki bot Rwot mamiyo pol mapek, mamiyo kot ma ngido i lobo, ka dok miyo dek twi i poto pa dano ducu. <verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Pien cal jogigu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="fk">Cal jogigu </char> kilwongo i leb Ibru ni Terapim. </note> giloko lok ma konye peke, ki lutyet gineno gin ma bwolo dano, wa jo ma leko lek bene gitito lek me goba, gikweyo cwiny dano nono. Omiyo lwak gilak ata macalo romi; gineno can pien lakwatgi peke.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Rwot owaco ni, “Kinigana olyeto tutwal ikom luloc ma gin lurok, abiketo can ikom lutela; pien Rwot me mony paro pi romine, ma en aye ot pa Juda. En bilokogi gidoko calo aguragurane ma wake i dog lweny. <verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Lutela matego macalo got me twok ot bia ki ikin jo pa Juda, kun gibicung matek liking macalo teke me guru kema, dok bene lulocgi bibedo matego macalo atum me lweny. <verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Jo pa Juda ducu bene gibibedo macalo oteka lweny, kun ginyono lukworgi piny i daba ma i dye yoo; gibilweny pien Rwot tye kwedgi, gibimiyo lewic mako jo ma giringo ki aguragura.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />En owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">“Abimedo tek bot jo me ot pa Juda, dok abilaro ot pa Yucepu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Abidwokogi cen pien kica maka ikomgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Gibibedo macalo jo mayam pe kong akwerogi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">pien an a Rwot Lubangagi, abigamo lega doggi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Jo Icrael bidoko tek macalo twoni oteka lweny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">cwinygi bibedo yom calo cwiny jo ma gitye kamato kongo bwino.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Lutinogi binenone, ci yomo cwinygi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">ci gibibedo ki yomcwiny ikom Rwot.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />Abilwongogi ki lwiyo kun acokogi kacel</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">ma calo lakwat lwiyo kun lwongo romine,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">pien dong atyeko kokogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">dong gibibedo mapol kit mayam con ca.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Kadi bed onongo akeyogi woko ikin lurok,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">ento gibipo pira ki i lobo ducu matye kamabor,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">gin kacel ki lutinogi gibibedo kwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">dok gibidwogo cen.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />Abidwokogi paco ki i lobo Ejipt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">dok abicokogi woko ki i Aciria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">abikelogi wa i lobo me Gilead ki Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">nio wang ma kabedo biremogi woko.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />Gibiwok ki i atwom madwong</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">macalo ngat ma wok ki i dye nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">ento an Rwotgi aye abikweyo tagge me nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">kut ducu ma i kulu Nail bitwo woko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Kibijuku wake pa jo Aciria woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">dok teko pa jo Ejipt bene birwenyo woko.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />Abimiyo jona gibedo matek i Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:12">ci gibiworo nyinga dok bene gibilubu lok ma mera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:12">an Rwot kikoma aye aloko man.”<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="s1">Rwot bituru twero pa luloc ma lugeroni woko</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Yab dogolani, in Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:1">wek mac owang yadi cedani woko!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Kok ba, in ciprec, pien yadi cedar dong kiretogi woko piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">pien yadi mabecone dong gubale woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Wukok ba, wun kworo me Bacan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">pien bunga ma oculeni dong kijwero woko piny!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Kong dong iwiny koko pa lukwat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">pien deyogi dong peke!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Kong iwiny koko pa labworgu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">pien yadi mukade i dog Jordan dong peke!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukwat aryo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Rwot Lubangana owaco bota ni, “In myero idok lakwat romi ma kipitogi me aneka. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Jo ma giwilo romi ginekogi dok ngat mo ma miyo ki gin pwod iye bene peke. Jo ma gicato romi giwaco ni, ‘Kipwo Rwot pien dong wadoko lulonyo!’ Wa lukwatgi bene kica pe makogi ikomgi.”<verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />(Pien kica dong pe bimaka ikom jo ma gibedo i loboni, man lok pa Rwot kikome. Nen, abimiyo ngat acel acel poto i cing lakwate, dong ngat acel acel bipoto i cing rwotgi. Dong gibibalo lobo, giweko dong nono, pe abilaro dano mo ki i cinggi.)<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Kitmeno adoko lakwat pi romi ma kiwilogi me anekani. Akwanyo odoo aryo, ci acako nying acel ni “Kica”, ki mukene acako nyinge “Ribe”, ci acako kwayo romi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Yam agiko tic pa lukwat meno adeki woko i dwe acel. Ento man otime pien onongo dong pe atwero diyo cwinya ikomgi, ki gin bene gubedo jo ma igi dong okwera woko. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Lacen awaco ki romi ni, “An gira pe abibedo lakwatwu. Romi ma myero oto, wek oto; romi ma myero kinekgi, wek kinekgi, ka wek mudonge, ngat acel acel omwod ringo kom lawote.” <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Ka dong akwanyo odoona ma nyinge “Kica”, ci aturu woko, ci aturu kwede gicike ma nene acike kwede ki rok ducu. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Kitmeno gicikenu kituru woko inino meno; ci lucat romi ma gubedo kanena, gungeyo ni meno obedo lok pa Rwot. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat 26:15</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:9-10">Mat 27:9-10</ref></char></note> Ka dong awaco botgi ni, “Kace wuneno ni ber, ci wumiya mucarana; ka kono pe, ci wuwek obedi.” Ci gupimo cekel pyere adek me ryal me mucarana. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Ci Rwot ocika ni, “Bol i ot me kano lim,” en lim ma gin gucula kwede i wel ma gutamoni maber tutwali. Kitmeno atero cekel pyere adeke ci abolo i ot kano lim ma i Ot pa Rwot. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Lacen ingeye dok aturu odoo me aryone, ma nyinge “Ribe”, kun aturu kwede bene ribe matye ikin Juda ki Icrael.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Ci Rwot dok ocika ni, “Dok ipor bedo calo lakwat ma konye peke. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Pien nen, abiyero lakwat mo ki i loboni ma pe biparo pi romi ma gito gitum wokoni, dok bene pe biyenyo romi ma rwenyo, dok pe bicango romi ma olimo ret, kadi wa pito jo ma komgi yot, ento en mere bimwodo ringo romi ma ocwene woko, kun yeco wa ringo ki ikom obong tyen gi.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />Lakwata man ma konye pekeni bineno can,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">ma en weko romi mere ata!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Pala lucwan myero otong bade,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">dok ocob wange ma lacuc.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Wek bade otal woko matwal, tekone bene otum woko matwal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">ci wange ma lacuc myero bene oto woko libok!”<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s1">Laro Jerucalem ikare me anyim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Man lok pa Rwot ikom Icrael: Rwot ma ceng oryeyo polo, dok oketo guti me te lobo, ki ma oketo cwiny dano i i dano, owaco kuman ni, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />“Nen acok miyo Jerucalem doko calo kikopo ma opong ki kongo ma mero rok ducu matye ingete, man miyo gicato macalo lamero kongo. Lukwor birumu taun madito ma i Juda ducu kacel ki Jerucalem bene gibirumu pi lweny ikome. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />Ento inino meno abimiyo Jerucalem bedo got mapek tutwal bot rok ducu; ci jo ducu ma gibitemo tingo gibilimo ret marac. Rok ducu me wi lobo biribe kacel me lweny ikome. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />I ninonu abibango kom aguragura ducu, ki jo ma ringo kwedgi gibidoko lupoya. Ento abiyabo wanga ikom ot pa Juda ikare ma abicoro wang aguragura pa lurok ducu. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Ka dong kaka me Juda bilok i cwinygi keken gi ni, ‘Jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem gitye ki tek ma oa bot Rwot me mony ma Lubangagi.’<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />Inino meno abimiyo kaka me Juda bedo macalo otako ma mac tye kalyel iye i dye yen ma kiduru, nyo macalo mac raa ma lyel ikin reng kal; ci gibiwango rok ducu matye ingetgi murumugi dyereni woko, ento jo me Jerucalem pud bidong ki gwok mera kakare kun jo ma iye gibedo mot ma opye.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />An Rwot aye abikwongo miyo loc i kema pa Juda, wek deyo me ot pa Daudi ki deyo pa jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem pe obed dit makato pa Juda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />Inino meno abigengo kor jo ma bedo i Jerucalem ki kwot, ci miyo jo magoro ikin gi bibedo tek calo Daudi, ci lakwar Daudi ma a ki ot pa Daudi ma telo wigi bibedo tek macalo lamalaika pa Rwot, dok bedo calo an kikoma aye ma atye katelo nyimgi kikome. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />Dok inino meno abineno ni kijwero rok ducu ma gibino ka lweny ikom Jerucalem.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 19:37">Jon 19:37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref></char>
    </note>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24:30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Niy 1:7</ref></char>
    </note> Abionyo cwiny me kica ki cwiny me bako dog ikom ot pa Daudi ki ikom jo ma bedo i Jerucalem, wek ka gineno ngat ma gicobo, ci gikumu pire, macalo ngat ma kumu pi latine acel keken ma en onywalo, kun kok matek macalo dano ma koko latin kayone ma oto. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />Inino meno kumu bibedo dit tutwal i Jerucalem marom ki kumu pi Adad-rimmon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="fk">Adad-rimmon </char> twero bedo nying jok Baal, lubanga me gin ducu malot i lobo Kaanan ki Ciria. Mwaka ki mwaka ka piny otwo woko, ci jo ma giworo jok Baal gikumu ki koko matek pien nongo gitamoni jokgi man bene oto woko. </note> i bar me Megiddo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Lobo bikumu, kun jo me dogola acel acel kumu pirgi ken gi; jo me ot pa Daudi pat kun nongo mon gi bene kumu pat; jo me ot pa Natan pat kun mon gi bene kumu pat; <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />jo me ot pa Levi pat kun mon gi bene kumu pat; jo me dogola pa Cimei pat kun mon gi bene kumu pat. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Ki jo ducu me dogola mukene ma gudong acel acel bikumu pirgi ken gi, kun mon gi bene gikumu pat.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />Inino meno kibitucu wang it pi jo me ot pa Daudi kacel ki pi jo ma gibedo i Jerucalem, wek kilwok bal ki keni ducu woko ki ikomgi. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />Inino meno, abijwayo nying cal jogi ducu woko ki i lobo, wek wi dano pe dok opo ikomgi; dok bene abikwanyo lunebi ma lugoba kacel ki cen maracu woko ki i lobo. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />Kace ngat mo pud tito lok macalo lanebi, ci wone ki mine ma gunywale gibiwace ni, ‘Pe ibibedo kwo, pien iloko lok me goba i nying Rwot’; ci wone ki mine ma gunywale gibicobe woko pil kace en bitito lok macalo lanebi.<verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />Inino meno lewic bimako lanebi acel acel pi ginanyutane ma en tito pire macalo lanebi bot dano. En dong bene pe biruku bongo ma obedo yeryer me bwolo jo ni ebedo lanebi me ada. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />Ento en biwaco ni, ‘An gira pe lanebi, an abedo lapur poto, pien poto man obedo mera ocake wa ka tinona.’ <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Ka ngat mo openye ni, ‘Lwak bur matye i ngeyini kono, gin ango ma otimo?’ Ci en bidok iye ni, ‘Meno ducu ret me wang odoo ma kigoya kwede ki i ot pa larema.’”<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiciko ni kinek lakwat romi pa Lubanga woko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />Rwot Lubanga Matwero ducu owaco ni, “In pala lucwan, co woko <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:31">Mat 26:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27">Mar 14:27</ref></char></note> wek ilweny ikom lakwata, ikom dano ma latica. Go lakwata ci ineke woko, wek romi guket woko ata. Abilwenyo wa ikom jona ma gitye <verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />i lobo man ducu, dul jo aryo me adek kibinekogi woko, ci acel me adeke aye bidong makwo. <verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />Dul man me acel me adek abiketo i mac, ci abiliyogi kit ma dano liyo ki ryal, abitemogi kit ma dano temo ki jabu. Gibilwongo nyinga, ci abigamo doggi. Abiwaco botgi ni, ‘Wun aye jona’; gin gibigamo ni, ‘Rwot en aye Lubangawa.’”<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s1">Jerucalem ki rok mukene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Nen ba, nino ma Rwot bingolo iye kop tye cok, en obimiyo lumerokwu biyako jamiwu woko ki botwu ci gibipokone ka wangwu ma wun bene oneno. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Pien Rwot bicoko rok ducu kacel ka lweny ikom Jerucalem. Ci gibimayo taunwu madit woko, gibiyako odi, dok gibimako mon ci gibutu kwedgi tektek. Nucu jo ma i taunwu madit kibiterogi woko i opii, ento jo mukene ma gudong pe gibiryemogi woko ki i taunwu madit. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Lacene Rwot bicito ka lweny ikom rok meno ducu, kit mayam con en olwenyo inino me lwenye. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />Inino meno en bicung iwi got me Jeituni, matye inyim Jerucalem tung kunyango; ci got me Jeituni bibare iye aryo, cake ki tung kunyango dok kwede tung kupotoceng, kun weko lung malac tutwal. Nucu got tung cel bidok tung kumalo, ki nucune mukeneni bidok tung kupiny. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />Wubiringo me lwi woko ki i nota kama obar ki ikom got. Ci wubiringo kit mayam kwariwu guringo oyengyeng ikare pa rwot Ujia me Juda. Ka lacen Rwot Lubangawu bibino kacel ki lumalaika mere maleng ducu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Inino meno, ngico ki koyo bibedo peke. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />Pinye bene bibedo dyeceng keken labongo colpiny mo pieno i otyeno ceng biryeny aryenya. Rwot gire kene aye ngeyo kare ma gin man bitime iye.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eje 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:38">Jon 7:38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Niy 22:1</ref></char>
    </note>Inino meno pii ma miyo kwo bimol kun a ki i Jerucalem, nucune bimol cito i nam ma tye tung kunyango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nam ma tung kunyango aye Nam me Kado, ki nam ma tung kupotoceng aye Nam Mediterranean. </char></note> ki nucune mukene bimol cito i nam matye tung kupotoceng; ci piine bibedo katime kumeno i oro kit macalo time kwede wa i cwir. <verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />Ci Rwot bidoko Rwot maloyo lobo ducu. Inino meno jo ducu biworo Rwot dok bene kibingeyo en ki nyinge acelu.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Lobo ducu bidoko bar, cake i Geba o wa i Rimmon matye tung kupiny inget Jerucalem. Ento Jerucalem bidong ma onyede kakare cake ki i Dogcel pa Benjamin o kwede wa i Dogcel Macon, nio i Dogcel ma i Twok taun madit, ki dok cake i Lubele me Kananel o wa i bur kama kibiyo iye pig olok pa rwot. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:3">Niy 22:3</ref></char></note>Dano bibedo i Jerucalem ki kuc, pien pe dok kibidyerone me ajwera woko.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Rwot bikelo two gemo ma bipwodo ki rok ducu ma giywayo mony ikom Jerucalem. Ringo komgi bitop ma nongo pud gucung ki tyen gi, wanggi bitop woko ki i opoko wanggi, ki lebgi bene bitop ki i doggi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Inino meno, atiba madwong ma oa ki bot Rwot bibango komgi woko, man bimiyo ngat acel acel bipoto ikom lawote me lweny kwede. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Kong inen, kadi Juda bene bilweny i Jerucalem me temo gwokone. Gibicoko lonyo pa rok ducu matye ingete, macalo jabu, ryal ki ginaruka mapol ata. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Kit gemo macalo man bene bipoto ikom aguragura, kana, kinaga, ki ikom lee ducu ma i gony pa lukworgi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">Lev 23:39-43</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngat acel acel ma obwot ki ikom rok ducu ma gubino ka lweny ikom Jerucalem, bibedo kawot i Jerucalem mwaka ki mwaka kaworo Rwot, ma en Rwot me mony, ki pi kwero Karama me nino madito me Bolo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Kace jo me kaka mo me wi lobo pe bicito i Jerucalem kaworo Rwot me mony macalo Rwot, ci kot pe bicwer botgi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Kace jo me dogola me Ejipt pe gucito, ma pe gunen kunu, ci gemo mayam Rwot ounu ki rok ma pe gucito ka kwero Karama me nino madito me Boloni bipoto ikomgi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Man aye kit ma kibiculu ki bal me Ejipt, ki kit ma kibiculu ki bal pa rok ducu ma pe gucito ka kwero Karama me nino madito me Bolo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />Inino meno kibigoro coc ikom olang ma kiruku ingut aguragura ni, “Kidyero bot Rwot.” Agulu matye i Ot pa Rwot bibedo maleng macalo becen matye inyim keno tyer. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Agulu ducu matye i Jerucalem ki Juda kibikwerogi bedo maleng pi Rwot me mony, wek jo ducu ma gityero gitum bot Lubanga gubin gukwany ki ikin gi, ci guted ki ringo lee ma gityero bot Lubanga. Lacatwil mo pe dok binen i Ot pa Rwot me mony inino meno.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>